  "assumptions": [
   "Power target: about 1500 per arm to detect 2.0 points at 80% power; interaction contrasts need roughly 2x the SE of the main effect (observed SE 0.995 at n=641 implies detecting about 2 points in subgroups at around 750 per cell).",
   "Roughly equal allocation across the two samples, with quotas by party; randomization within sample and party strata",
   "Second sample is a probability-based or alternative panel; sample source is recorded from panel metadata",
   "Analyses are pre-registered; ANCOVA with pre-treatment thermometer or UDP; HC2 errors",
   "Thermometer is collected as an 11-point grid (0 to 100 in steps of 10) because slider items are not available; in-party minus out-party is computed from party identification and leaning"
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "Hosting of the Perception gap video file",
   "Choice of second panel vendor, compensation and IRB number"
